-- title:
--   Dimension $8$
-- statement:
--   **The rung $r=8$ of Challenge 7: Viazovska's theorem.** The sphere-packing constant of $\mathbb R^8$ equals its lattice-packing constant:
--
--   $$\Delta_8=\Delta_8^L .$$
--
--   Both equal $\pi^4/384$, attained by the $E_8$ lattice.
-- source:
--   M. S. Viazovska, The sphere packing problem in dimension 8, Ann. of Math. 185 (2017), 991–1015, https://doi.org/10.4007/annals.2017.185.3.7; Lean formalization: https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.23468

